{"data":{"repository":{"pullRequest":{"number":1200,"title":"(v2) feat: ferocious renderer","body":"~This implements a cell-based renderer instead of the existing line-based one. The cell-based renderer will be used when `TEA_EXPERIMENTAL=cellbuf` is exported.~ The cell-based renderer, now called The Ferocious Renderer, is enabled by default. To disable it set `TEA_EXPERIMENTAL=unferocious`.\r\n\r\nTo _trace_ the output of the program, you can export `TEA_TRACE=<filename>` and `TEA_TRACE_OUTPUT=1` and/or `TEA_TRACE_INPUT=1` to see the I/O of the program.\r\n\r\nSupersedes: https://github.com/charmbracelet/bubbletea/pull/1132","url":"https://github.com/charmbracelet/bubbletea/pull/1200","state":"MERGED","isDraft":false,"createdAt":"2024-10-23T20:26:34Z","additions":761,"deletions":45,"changedFiles":19,"headRefName":"v2-renderer","baseRefName":"v2-exp","author":{"login":"aymanbagabas","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3187948?u=fe66481bdd0c6a79c90e766e72e2cb824b1f59c5&v=4"},"reviewRequests":{"nodes":[{"requestedReviewer":{"login":"caarlos0","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245435?u=016c628e1a5b95034b2b1af297827b7f545809bc&v=4"}},{"requestedReviewer":{"login":"meowgorithm","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25087?u=1dc2f182860e2771dbb0c33226a0ef89aecd5f17&v=4"}}]},"latestReviews":{"nodes":[]},"commits":{"totalCount":36,"nodes":[{"commit":{"statusCheckRollup":null}}]},"files":{"totalCount":19,"nodes":[{"path":"cursor.go","additions":24,"deletions":7},{"path":"examples/go.mod","additions":3,"deletions":0},{"path":"examples/go.sum","additions":6,"deletions":0},{"path":"examples/simple/main_test.go","additions":3,"deletions":0},{"path":"ferocious_renderer.go","additions":604,"deletions":0},{"path":"go.mod","additions":6,"deletions":1},{"path":"go.sum","additions":6,"deletions":0},{"path":"key_test.go","additions":1,"deletions":1},{"path":"logging_test.go","additions":2,"deletions":2},{"path":"options.go","additions":